 "text": "Hey, nice to hear from you. How are you? Very common. Draw a line under the eye socket, meeting the nose at the top of the eye, and many eyes will look right. Go halfway up the eye between the eyelid and the temple. That's the spot. The nose usually wants to point directly at the middle of the eye. You' see a difference fast. And once you get one face looking right, you' see how the other one compares.",
